(R/P/'README.md').write_text('# Inactive current335 Bio8 integration after genuine A and fresh blind B\n\nThis final entry supersedes the package-local pre-B draft. Its technical owner authored two previous corrections and supplies no independent D/P/V judgment. The completed genuine A and fresh blind B records, exact original native8 contexts and current actual original/360/680/whole HTML/PDF captures are bound. Normal dual-round summary and all eight closed KEEP resolutions passed. P8 remains needs_human_review, reviewAuthority ai_candidate, E1/G1, approved0, with the literal author reviewID and all16caseIDs/expectations unchanged. No human approval, trial or laboratory execution is claimed.\n\nAll394 complete page bodies equal the reviewed v3 model; all335 protected pages,392 other v2 pages and386 pages outside this batch remain exact. Eight legacy V notes now explicitly refer to the historical pending preparation state; current independent A and fresh B are completed. That annotation changes only the normal model source.goalVisualizationQaDigest and global model digest, with no page-body change. Actual first failed technical checks and corrected terminal runs remain retained.\n\nROOT copy plan has27 operations: exact whole479 with8resourceLinks, exact paired QA394 with8updated rows,24 exact PNG copies, and one Bio-only registry merge adding1P8 config and1D8 index. Existing51P/60D entries, operative A394/M394/kinds394, in-flight ledger, source50/31pairs/24scopes and other subjects remain retained. ROOT must verify current guards, adopt and run the required current strict report before counting any gain. Active gain here is0. No active/Git/GitHub write or full stable build was performed.\n\nThe old sealed v2 all228portable claim was inaccurate: one inherited official primaryHTML existed locally at a Git-ignored path. Frozen v3 binds an exact committable copy at sources/legacy-source-portable/bundle/book.html. The old spelling is diagnostic history only; no seal, validator or filename exception was altered. Historical root standalone SUPPORT metadata swapped the P status/authority labels; the final entry states their correction without changing those records. Genuine fresh B also retains an additive correction of its own FIRST enzyme range narrative; science/material is unchanged.\n\nTechnical scripts Apache-2.0; own didactic content CC-BY-4.0; third-party rights unchanged.\n')
